  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Mid-term Review of The EUROPEAN UNION GLOBAL ACCESS AND TRADE EXPERTISE (EU GATE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;global objective&lt;/strong&gt; of this evaluation is twofold:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and the wider public with an overall independent assessment of the performance of the &#xbf;European Union Global Access and Trade Expertise (EU GATE) in Cambodia&#xbf;&lt;em&gt;,&lt;/em&gt; paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives and to the reasons underpinning such results; and&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to identify key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;inform decision makers&lt;/span&gt; on how to improve current and future interventions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt; for this evaluation are: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;To be accountable for the use of EU resources in relation to the results of the intervention&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;To report transparently on EU support to the trade and private sector in Cambodia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;To inform the exit strategy of the intervention to ensure the sustainability of its results&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
